    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yobbu naalengesibwa nkooku arukugonza Ruhanga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunsi eya Uzi hakaba haliyo omusaija ibara lye Yobbu; omusaija ogu akaba ataina kamogo kandi muhikiriire, ayatiinaga Ruhanga naafuhya obubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akazaara abaana aboojo musanju, abaisiki basatu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaba atungire entaama kasanju, engamiya enkumi isatu, ente rukumi, n'endogoyi ebuguma rukumi, n'abaheereza baingi muno; omusaija ogu, nikyo yakirraga abantu boona aba Burugaizooba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batabani be baagendaga bacumba obugenyi, buli muntu omunju ye kandi ha kiro kye; baatumahoga abanyanya abaisiki abasatu nibabaraliza kwija balye kandi banywe na bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiro ekyakuratahoga obugenyi buraire buhoire, Yobbu yabeetaga, baija abeeza, kandi yazindukaga nyenkya kara, ahonga ebihongwa eby'okwokya, ebirukwinganaingana omuhendo gwabo, habwokuba yateekerezaaga ati: “Abaana bange banu, tibaikara kuba basobeze bakajuma Ruhanga.” Eki, Yobbu nukwo yamazire akasumi naakikora ati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.6.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 6:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu hakabaho ekiro, ab'omwiguru eki baiziireho kukurata hali MUKAMA, Sitaani na uwe yabaiziramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yakaguza Sitaani ati: “Nooruga nkaha?” Sitaani yagarukamu MUKAMA ati: “Ninduga kugendagenda omunsi, ningitemba ningitemburruka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yagaruka yamukaguza ati: “Omuheereza wange Yobbu omuteekeriizeeho, nkooku hatarumu n'omu arukumusisana, omusaija ataina kamogo, kandi omuhikiriire, anyakutiina Ruhanga kandi anyakufuuhya obubi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.12.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kus 12:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sitaani yakaguza MUKAMA ati: “Mara Yobbu ogu, Ruhanga amutiinira busa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otamuzitirre orukoroba wamwehinguliriza n'enju ye na byona ebi ainabyo, orubaju n'orubaju? Emirimo ye yoona ogiha omugisa, ebintu byeyongiire kukanya omunsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu hati, lengaho omwiheho byona ebi ainabyo, naija kukujumiraho aho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yagambira Sitaani ati: “Byona ebi ainabyo obiinaho obusobozi, bikole nkooku orukwenda; kyonka uwe, otamukoraho.” Aho Sitaani yaruga omumaiso ga MUKAMA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiro kimu, batabani ba Yobbu na bahara be obu bakaba nibalya kandi nibanywa eviini omunju ya mukuru wabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yobbu akahikwaho omukwenda yamugambira ati: “Ente zawe zibaire niirima, n'enkaina niirya ziziri haihi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nubwo haija Abasabbeya baazigwera bainyaga abaheereza bawe baabaisa ebitara; nyowe nyenka, ninyowe nsigaireho, nkugambire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu obu akaba atakamazire kubaza, haija ondi yagamba ati: “Omurro gwa Ruhanga gurugire omwiguru gwagwa, gwayokya entaama n'abaheereza boona busaho ekisigaireho; nyowe nyenka, ninyowe ntabukire, nukwo kwija kukugambira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu na uwe obu akaba naakyabaza, haija ondi yagamba ati: “Abakalidaaya beecwiremu ebicweka bisatu baatuseesira, baanyaga engamiya, abaheereza baabaisa ekitara; nyowe nyenka ninyowe ntabukire, nkugambire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu na uwe obu akaba naakyabaza, haija ondi yagamba ati: “Batabani bawe na bahara bawe babaire nibanywa eviini omunju ya mukuru wabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "haimuka ihunga lyacwanganiza irungu, lyateera ha nsonda ina ez'enju, enju yagwera abantu abo abato boona baafa; nyowe nyenka ninyowe nsigaireho, nukwo kwija kukugambira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Yobbu yaimukire, yatemura ebijwaro bye, yayemwa isoke, yajuumara hansi, yaramya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "SIR.40.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Sir 40:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "SIR.11.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "11:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagamba ati: “Nkazaarwa ntaina kantu, tinditwara kantu; MUKAMA nuwe yampaire, kandi hati nuwe atwaire; ibara lye likugizibwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
